                        "entry_id": "cae61910-9191-3df0-a485-97d829a2d264",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pudding similar to pastry cream but thickened with gelatin or isinglass instead of flour or cornstarch, and flavoured with liqueur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
